flickos-kits (1.2~test1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Security work: the six security kits in a list of their own under
    the permission sentence, folded until one is installed or the window
    opens on one; setup steps to capture packets without administrator
    rights and to choose a Wi-Fi adapter for testing (setup capture,
    setup test-adapter, doctor) (docs/design/flickos-security.md, phase
    2).
  * Environments (docs/design/flickos-dev.md 8c, flickos-security.md
    phase 3): rootless distrobox containers of Debian testing for the
    developer kits and Kali for the security kits, with the kits' lists
    inside (env list, plan, new, update, stop, remove, terminal, export,
    database); env new shows today's sizes from the image's own apt and
    asks first. The window's Environments section, New Environment… and
    Install Containers Kit….
  * Newer versions (docs/design/flickos-dev.md 8a and 8b; flickos-
    security.md ADR-S07): mise and Rapid7's Metasploit Framework from
    their makers' repositories, and per-user versions of the installed
    kits' tools through mise (Use the Latest, Keep This Version, Back to
    the Computer's Version, Update All); version list, maker, use and
    update; doctor lines.
  * Breaks flickos-control << 1.82~ and flickos-software << 1.24~, whose
    settings and Security Tools its rows use.

